Z||000000||ThatRickGuy||05-23-2001||08:38 AM||||Damn, I tell ya, just when you think you're good to take a few weeks off from the shop. Just finished the front end rebuild (shocks, ball joints, all poly) all new tires, a 4 wheel alignment, and getting the timing set (my light is broke  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ) and now, it's giving my a nasty bump noise in parking lot steering (sounds like a ball joint went out allready!) I'm hearing a droaning noise from the rear end, most likely the wheel bearings, I'm still trying to track down which exhaust port is leaking, I've got a little burp in acceleration just above idle, and THAT DAMN TEMP GUAGE IS STILL PISSING ME OFF!!!<P>arg... at least my new exhaust should be in today.||||reg||1
