Z||000003||curtis||05-23-2001||11:37 PM||||Hey ThatRickGuy when I had my suspension done I had the same bump noise. It turned out to be one of the new ball joints was not prelubed like I thought. Lubed all four and no more bump. Hope that helps.||||reg||1
